@startuml
title SD-UI05 — Event application and quote
caption To-Be draft | F05 · Frontend · Customer /events/new and /events/:id · merchant /merchant/events/:id
actor User
boundary "Route and EventRequestForm, QuoteReview and QuoteEditor" as UI
participant "Shared API client" as Client
participant "Authorized API" as API
User -> UI : Open view or submit action
opt Customer considers cancellation before deposit verification
 UI -> User : Ask whether a transfer was sent
 UI --> User : Explain cancellation is unavailable if sent or uncertain
end
UI -> Client : events, quotes, accept-quote or cancel before transfer
Client -> API : Fetch or submit with applicable guards
alt Success
 API --> Client : Current typed result
 Client --> UI : Render or refresh authoritative data
else date invalid or quote superseded
 API --> Client : Typed failure
 Client --> UI : Keep draft fields or refresh current quote
end
@enduml
